      "category": "K2Node_CustomEvent",
      "signature": "IsOverride(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UK2Node_CustomEvent*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Discernible from the base UK2Node_Event's bOverrideFunction field. This\nchecks to see if this UK2Node_CustomEvent overrides another CustomEvent\ndeclared in a parent blueprint.\n@return True if this CustomEvent's name matches another CustomEvent's name, declared in a parent (false if not)."
    },
    {
      "id": "get-net-flags",
      "name": "GetNetFlags",
      "category": "K2Node_CustomEvent",
      "signature": "GetNetFlags(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UK2Node_CustomEvent*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UInt",
      "docs": "If a CustomEvent overrides another CustomEvent, then it inherits the\nsuper's net flags. This method does that work for you, either returning\nthe super function's flags, or this node's flags (if it's not an override).\n@return If this CustomEvent is an override, then this is the super's net flags, otherwise it's from the FunctionFlags set on this node."
    },
